      "content": "honestly i dont even know why im typing this. i just feel like i've hit a wall and there's no way over it. everything i've worked for the last decade feels like a joke now and i'm just so incredibly tired. like, physically and mentally exhausted in a way that sleep doesn't even touch. it just feels like a never ending loop of failing and trying to fix things that are fundamentally broken. i feel like i'm just dragging this heavy weight around for no reason anymore.",
