      "content": "thanks. but when you say \"let yourself rest\"... i don't mean like taking a weekend off. i mean it feels like any kind of real rest would require me to just... stop existing. like the only way to actually stop the noise and the pressure is to just exit the whole situation completely. it just feels so much more logical than trying to keep pretending i can handle this.",
